"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.64のマリオストーリー、プレステのクラッシュバンディグー、牧場物語、ポケモンクリスタル、ポケモンルビー、セガサターンのソニック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号のブブカ発売したよー！\nななせとわたしで表紙だからみつけてね(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、CanCamにもさゆりんとでてますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月から2号連続で、ありがたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてねっ！(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21697":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様(  ˙︶˙  )\nおはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごきげんいかがですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46　2期生研究生\nテラダランゼ\n寺田　蘭世"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校1年生\n16歳\n9月23日生まれ\n天秤座\n血液型不明\n約155cm\n靴のサイズ22.5㎝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❀目次✿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・特別企画"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、実力不足では\nありますが\n時間かかってもいいのでもっと\n頑張っていきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/11/18/0884632/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/11/18/0884632/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/11/18/0884632/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/11/18/0884632/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/11/